# Design tokens

Color, type, radius, shadow, and duration live only in `@theme`, `:root`, and `.dark` in `src/app/globals.css`. A color change updates both themes.

## Usage

Components use semantic utilities: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`, `ring-ring`. No raw hex, `hsl()`, or `oklch()` in TSX.

One radius scale, one shadow scale, one duration token.

- Button sizes live in `src/components/ui/button.tsx`. Sections do not override height or padding on a size variant.
- Card border, radius, and hover live in `src/components/ui/card.tsx`. A hover style is on the primitive, or absent.

## Effect utilities

Remove these during a restyle. Do not rename them: `glass-morphism`, `premium-gradient`, `text-gradient`, `hero-glow`, `shadow-premium`, `enter-*`, `reveal-*`, `scroll-reveal`.

```tsx
// Bad — color invented in the component
<div className="bg-[oklch(0.55_0.22_260)] shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)]">

// Good — token from globals.css
<div className="bg-card border border-border shadow-sm">
```
